# Local ledgers written by the two dev launch configurations (CUG_STORAGE_ROOT).
# These are gitignored, but vsce ignores .gitignore entirely once a .vscodeignore
# exists — so without these two lines the dev host's sessions/, weeks/ and
# poll.lease ship inside the vsix.
